# ===== IDE & Editor =====
.idea/
.vscode/

# ===== Local AI / Coding tool state =====
.workbuddy/
.opencode/
.mavis/

# ===== Host mirror directories (per-skill activation targets) =====
# These should never be the canonical source — `activate` regenerates them.
/.agents/
/.claude/
/.qoder/
/.trae/
/.codebuddy/
/.cursor/
/.windsurf/
/.openclaw/

# ===== Node.js =====
node_modules/
package-lock.json

# ===== Python =====
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/

# ===== Build / Distribution artifacts =====
# Generated by `python devtools/package_skill.py`; `skill.manifest.json` 分发排除中已列出
/testcase-generator.skill
/testcase-generator.zip
/_pkg_log.txt
/_pkg_result.txt
/package_log.txt

# ===== Skill local state =====
# 注意：`skills/` 不再是镜像目录，而是 **canonical 技能树**
# （`skills/testcase-generator/`，符合 Agent Skills 标准布局）。它必须被跟踪。
# 各客户端的激活产物是上面那批点号开头的宿主目录，不是这里。
/skills-lock.json
/test-output/

# ===== Knowledge base (rebuild locally, never commit) =====
# `knowledge/index.json` is generated from `knowledge/sources/*.md` by
# `python knowledge/scripts/build_index.py`. Rebuild after editing sources.
# It's not portable across machines (mtime + sha) and may contain project-
# specific data the user does not want to share.
/skills/testcase-generator/knowledge/index.json

# ===== Project-specific local run state =====
/test-fixtures/.cache/

# 站点构建的临时产物目录。CI 用 `--out _site` 生成后直接上传为 Pages 制品，
# 不需要入库；`docs/` 下已提交的产物才是仓库内的站点来源。
/_site/
/_site_test/

# `test-fixtures/skill-eval/` 有两类文件，处理方式不同：
#   · 正式 fixture（5 个，已被 .harness/eval/run_eval.py 的 build_fixture_registry
#     登记、并在 EXPECTED_OUTPUTS.md 中声明）→ **必须跟踪**，是 eval 的输入基线。
#   · 即席调试产物（扫描输出、临时脚本、模拟 patch）→ 不进库。
# 下面的模式只匹配后者：正式 fixture 的 stem 固定为那 5 个，不会命中。
/test-fixtures/skill-eval/scan_result*.json
/test-fixtures/skill-eval/scan_result*.md
/test-fixtures/skill-eval/live_scan*.md
/test-fixtures/skill-eval/debug_state.py
/test-fixtures/skill-eval/verify_fix.py

# ===== OS =====
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
